WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.038
Same metric, different spaces.

2
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.611
A bijection stretching every distance by a bounded

3
00:00:05.611 --> 00:00:08.245
factor. Must the spaces then match linearly?

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:13.071
Bend Hilbert space slightly, linearize, and build two different graph spaces.

5
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:17.555
Claimed: not necessarily, even for separable spaces.

6
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.427
Main theorem Lean-checked.
